# The regions the T2T consortium's masked analysis sets hard-mask, named, as Arang Rhie's T2T-Ref README lists them
# (Phillippy lab; BED coordinates, 0-based half-open, on T2T-CHM13v2.0 with UCSC names):
#   https://github.com/arangrhie/T2T-Ref/blob/0aa9717563a817ff71d6431b3259ea06296ced78/README.md
# Only the masked rows: the README's kept representative copies (chr13's DJ, first rDNA unit and PHR; chr1's first
# 5S unit) are left out. chrY's masks (all of it for XX samples, its PARs for XY) are layer_chry and layer_par_y.
# The layers task refuses unless, on each chromosome a derived mask names, these rows tile the N-runs it reads from
# the published file exactly (book.toml derived_masks, `labels`).
